===Go to the Tempering Workshop and find Clara{{subst:void|<!--201091002-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Rivet Town|update|Clara sent you an invitation to go check out Pascal. Go meet up with Clara at the Tempering Workshop in Rivet Town.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Obtain {{Предмет|Flower Made From Scrap Iron|20|x=1}})

;(Talk to Clara)
:'''Clara:''' Good boy, Pascal!
:'''Clara:''' ...Oh, it's you! I'm just doing a checkup on Pascal.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How has Pascal been recently?
:'''Clara:''' He's been doing great &mdash; Mr. Svarog's programs are extremely effective... It's just hard to know if it will last...
:'''Clara:''' Would you like to speak with Pascal?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Uhh... How are you doing?
::'''Pascal:''' I, I, I! Very, good!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What have you been up to recently?
::'''Pascal:''' Pascal, carry out, Clara, mission!
::'''Pascal:''' Protect, Rivet Town! Waiting, everybody, come back, live, together!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You haven't been stealing anymore, have you?
::'''Pascal:''' No, Pascal! Clara, say, wrong, stealing!
::'''Pascal:''' Pascal, not, again, steal! Carry out, Clara, mission!
:'''Clara:''' Hehe, you're in good health, Pascal. Today's checkup is over &mdash; shall we head back now?
:'''Pascal:''' Please wait...
:'''Pascal:''' Flower, flower, flower, for you &mdash; don't forget.
:'''Clara:''' ...Huh?
:'''Pascal:''' Pascal, make, make myself! Scraps, parts, materials! Not stolen, very clean.
:'''Pascal:''' (Trailblazer), good! Pascal, happy!
:'''Pascal:''' Thank you, thank you! Thank you, Clara, (Trailblazer)!
:'''Clara:''' ...Thank you, Pascal.
:'''Clara:''' Umm... {{MC|ж=big sister|м=big brother}}, would you like a flower?
;(Unused &mdash; Wait_Option_201090632_25)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm glad to see you're doing well.
