::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He's still talking a little funny.
:::'''Clara:''' Oh, I tried to fix Pascal's language module by installing a new chip.
:::'''Clara:''' ...It didn't seem to make much difference though. Still, at least we can understand what he's saying... I'll leave him alone for now.
:::'''Pascal:''' Not, not quite, running, smoothly! Very, apologies!
:'''Clara:''' Hehe, you're in good health, Pascal. Today's checkup is over &mdash; shall we head back now?
